WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.560
Señor, ¿qué pasará?

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.760
to the lot I purchased today?

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.360
Ma'am, do you realize the gravity

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:08.280
of the charges against you?

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.000
As for your purchase,

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.720
I don't know all the procedures,

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.760
but I assume the auction results

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.120
are probably canceled.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.240
There are some questions

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:20.520
about the legitimacy of your funds.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.880
My money is clean.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.920
And, sir, I need those paintings.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.360
My advice.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.040
Focus on what I'm showing you.

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:31.120
Once again,

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.040
Is this your container?

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.440
Yes. I...

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:39.200
I rented it six months ago at the port.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.200
For what purpose?

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.440
I was recovering art pieces

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:44.200
that belonged to my family

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.280
and stored them there.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:48.400
You're calling these “art pieces”?
